WEBVTT

00:00.200 --> 00:09.600
MathBoard — just type for beautiful board notes.
A math whiteboard for teaching online.

00:09.900 --> 00:17.900
Column multiplication. Type into the grid
and jot down carry notes.

00:18.000 --> 00:27.000
Long division. Draw the bracket and work
through the quotient and remainder.

00:27.200 --> 00:35.400
Adding and subtracting fractions — from common
denominators to reducing, cleanly displayed.

00:35.600 --> 00:41.400
Dividing fractions. The flip-and-multiply
flow stays perfectly intact.

00:41.600 --> 00:49.200
Quadratic equations. Steps align at the "=",
and factoring is easy to read.

00:49.300 --> 00:57.200
Shapes. Draw with the line tool
and add angles or comments.

00:57.400 --> 01:06.600
Start with the free trial.
Your online board notes will change.
